        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Walter Van Tilburg Clark, Billie Letts\n- Works: The Watchful Gods and Other Stories, Where the Heart Is\n- Roles: novelists, short story writers, educators\n\nFacts:\n- Walter Van Tilburg Clark was an American novelist, short story writer, and educator who lived from August 3, 1909 to November 10, 1971.\n- Billie Letts, born Billie Dean Letts and née Gipson, was an American novelist and educator who lived from May 30, 1938 to August 2, 2014.\n- The Watchful Gods and Other Stories is a collection of short stories by Walter Van Tilburg Clark that was published in 1950.\n- Where the Heart Is is a novel by Billie Letts that was published in 1995.",
